    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpour is a puzzle game where gargoyles manipulate the flow of interactive bodies of water to solve levels. In order to win, push and pull blocks to change how water flows throughout the stage. Sever all possible drainage points until only one remains, and traverse your way to the remaining runoff to make your gargoyle become a spout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water permeates throughout the stage via a procedural grid-based system. It's intuitive, yet full of unexpected complexity and delights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/f5fee0dbdfca702b3f42fb845e663584.poster.avif?t=1752694113\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/f5fee0dbdfca702b3f42fb845e663584.webm?t=1752694113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/f5fee0dbdfca702b3f42fb845e663584.mp4?t=1752694113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game invites the player to explore its systems through various thoughtfully designed mechanics such as water-blocking blocks, floating rafts, traversable tightropes, and many watery intricacies, providing over 100 detailed hand-crafted levels.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpour is a puzzle game where gargoyles manipulate the flow of interactive bodies of water to solve levels. In order to win, push and pull blocks to change how water flows throughout the stage. Sever all possible drainage points until only one remains, and traverse your way to the remaining runoff to make your gargoyle become a spout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water permeates throughout the stage via a procedural grid-based system. It's intuitive, yet full of unexpected complexity and delights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/f5fee0dbdfca702b3f42fb845e663584.poster.avif?t=1752694113\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/f5fee0dbdfca702b3f42fb845e663584.webm?t=1752694113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/f5fee0dbdfca702b3f42fb845e663584.mp4?t=1752694113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game invites the player to explore its systems through various thoughtfully designed mechanics such as water-blocking blocks, floating rafts, traversable tightropes, and many watery intricacies, providing over 100 detailed hand-crafted levels.</p>",
    "short_description": "A puzzle game about manipulating the flow of water. Push blocks to reroute streams, navigate deeper waters, and spout water away from the church walls.",
